                    "text": "Why Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-sun-state"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sun-state-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International's parts department serves Tampa and the surrounding area with access to OEM and aftermarket parts for all makes and models, not just International trucks. Our team can help you decide whether a new or used part is the right call for your situation, and our service department is right there to install it if you need us to.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sun-state-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You can also browse and order through our online parts store anytime, so you're not stuck waiting on a callback to know what's in stock.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
