                {
                  "id": "p-get-what-you-need-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Downtime in Tampa's heat and traffic isn't something any fleet can afford to wait out. Whether you're after a new component or a dependable used part, having a trusted source lined up before you need one is what keeps your trucks moving. Visit our Tampa parts department or order online, and schedule a service appointment if you need the part installed.",
